\caption{Ordered rooted tree representation of the lattice paths in Lemma~\ref{lemma:hinv-is-tau1} (left) and Lemma~\ref{lemma:hinv-is-tau2} (right). The edges in which the trees differ are drawn bold, and the grey areas represent particular subtrees.}
